暢，極其聰慧，此後十天便如人類小孩一年，直至成年。    芳華獸乃至情之物，若成年獸不墮紅塵，心如明鏡，可長命乃至修仙，動情者便如荒草，歲歲枯榮，浴入火海，反覆輪迴。若被情傷，十日將如凡人一年，直至墮入輪迴化為枯木，情傷愈重，木質色澤愈黑，化毒藥性愈強。    芳華絕色，世間難尋，此獸乃至情至性之物，終其一生為情所困，終逃不脫情殤之劫，成正果者少之又少。)[2;37;0m","name":"[1;36m芳[1;33m華[1;37m木[2;37;0m","id":"mu","unit":"根","nj":30,]),([]),1,/),(/"[1;35m天師護身符[2;37;0m","tianshi charm",({"tianshi charm","charm",}),"/clone/goods/tianshi-charm",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;37m鑽石勳章[2;37;0m","diamond xunzhang",({"diamond xunzhang","diamond","xunzhang","medal",}),"/clone/medal/diamond_xunzhang",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;33m勇士勳章[2;37;0m","yongshi xunzhang",({"yongshi xunzhang","yongshi","xunzhang","medal",}),"/clone/medal/yongshi_xunzhang",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;35m魔界佛心果[2;37;0m","magic fruit",({"magic fruit","magic","fruit",}),"/clone/item/magicfruit",0,0,8,/),(/"[33m地藏之石[2;37;0m","dizang zhishi",({"dizang zhishi","shi",}),"/clone/goods/dizangshi",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;32m九花玉露丸[2;37;0m","jiuhua wan",({"jiuhua wan","wan",}),"/clone/medicine/jiuhua",0,0,20,/),(/"[1;33mVIP勳章[2;37;0m","vip xunzhang",({"vip xunzhang","vip","xunzhang","medal",}),"/clone/medal/vip_xunzhang",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;36m六脈神劍譜[2;37;0m","sixfinger book",({"sixfinger book","book",}),"/clone/book/six_book",0,0,1,/),(/"[1;31m精魂石碎片[2;37;0m","jinghun shi",({"jinghun shi","jinghun","shi",}),"/clone/tessera/jhunshi",(["value":12000,"auto_load":1,"enchase":(["type":"staff","apply_prop":(["da_power":6.000000,"add_freeze":2.500000,]),]),"set_data":1,"quality_level":6,"name":"[1;31m精魂石碎片[2;37;0m","id":"jinghun shi","unit":"塊","long":"[1;31m稀有度較高的裝備分解後所得到的核心碎片，擁有著神奇的力量。[2;37;0m",]),([]),1,/),(/"[1;31m精魂石碎片[2;37;0m","jinghun shi",({"jinghun shi","jinghun","shi",}),"/clone/tessera/jhunshi",(["value":12000,"name":"[1;31m精魂石碎片[2;37;0m","auto_load":1,"enchase":(["apply_prop":(["avoid_freeze":0,"counter_damage":2.500000,"avoid_blind":1.500000,"reduce_busy":2.500000,]),"type":"armor",]),"id":"jinghun shi","quality_level":6,"unit":"塊","long":"[1;31m稀有度較高的裝備分解後所得到的核心碎片，擁有著神奇的力量。[2;37;0m",]),([]),1,/),(/"